      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a solid start and definitely professional. \n\ni just ran it through the tool and it's actually scoring a bit lower than i'd like for a 'gold standard' example (it's sitting at about a 0.65). for the initiative to really take off, i need to show management that we can hit those 0.9+ levels. \n\ncan you try another version? i still need it to be a real, usable response to a shipping delay, but let's see if you can push that positivity index much higher. just try to make it even more upbeat and warm so it registers better with the classifier, but keep it somewhat grounded in reality.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
